const maxVal = Math.max(...arr); // Using spread operator
console.log(maxVal);
```

**Option 2: Manual Loop**
```javascript
const arr = [10, 324, 45, 90, 9808];

let maxVal = arr[0];
for (let i = 1; i < arr.length; i++) {
    if (arr[i] > maxVal) {
        maxVal = arr[i];
    }
}
console.log(maxVal);
```

---

### Java
**Option 1: Using Streams (Java 8+)**
```java
