**Solution:**

```java
int max = scores[0]; // Assume first element is max

for (int i = 1; i < scores.length; i++) {
    if (scores[i] > max) {
        max = scores[i]; // Update max if current element is larger
    }
}
System.out.println("Maximum Score: " + max);
```

